045417] [17592186284509 #edb/ref 1069 "q-164543" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186284509 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186284509 #edb/ref 1071 "Identify the following surface:\n\n$$\n4{y}^{2}-3{z}^{2}=1,\\,-\\infty <x<\\infty .\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186284509 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "8f6408ec-2d9a-573b-91f2-4270763372c3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186284509 #edb/ref 1074 "Recall that the equation of a hyperbolic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $z$-axis is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nThus, a hyperbolic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $x$**-axis** is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{{c}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, our equation is a hyperbolic cylinder whose axis of symmetry is the $x$-axis and $b=\\frac{1}{2},\\,c=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401544 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186401545 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401544 #edb/ref 1069 "q-164553" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401544 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401544 #edb/ref 1071 "Identify the surface $5{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}-5{z}^{2}+20x+10z+15=0.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401544 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "040e9acf-1af9-5813-86f6-e469cb0eecc9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401544 #edb/ref 1074 "First, we complete the square in the $x$ and $z$ terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}-5{z}^{2}+20x+10z+15 & =0 \\\\ 5({x}^{2}+4x)-{y}^{2}-5({z}^{2}-2z)+15 & =0 \\\\ 5[(x+2)^{2}-4]-{y}^{2}-5[(z-1)^{2}-1]+15 & =0 \\\\ 5(x+2)^{2}-20-{y}^{2}-5(z-1)^{2}+5+15 & =0 \\\\ 5(x+2)^{2}-{y}^{2}-5(z-1)^{2} & =0 \\\\ -5(x+2)^{2}+{y}^{2}+5(z-1)^{2} & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is the equation of an elliptic cone centered at $(-2,0,1).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401545 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401546 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401545 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401547 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401545 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401548 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401545 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401549 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401545 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401550 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401545 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401545 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401545 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186401547 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401545 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "fffbfe5a-e6b2-509f-a19b-67c3c7c49922" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401546 #edb/ref 1080 "An elliptic cone centered at $(-2,0,-1)$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401546 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401546 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "f1243d3b-361e-5bdf-975f-049a3ec6fa01" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401547 #edb/ref 1080 "An elliptic cone centered at $(-2,0,1)$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401547 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401547 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "fa487f89-3be7-5d40-961d-7546309e11de" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401548 #edb/ref 1080 "A hyperboloid of two sheet centered at $(-2,0,1)$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401548 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401548 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "025044f2-a8e8-56c9-abcc-e56e1609a263" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401549 #edb/ref 1080 "A hyperboloid of one sheet centered at $(-2,0,1)$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401549 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401549 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "1c63b753-83a9-5faf-9522-2b10200701ec" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401550 #edb/ref 1080 "An elliptic cone centered at $(-2,1,1)$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401550 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401550 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "a76c934a-6a50-5b6b-97fe-08774387e03f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402488 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186402489 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402488 #edb/ref 1069 "q-36107" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402488 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402488 #edb/ref 1071 "Identify the surface $4{y}^{2}+8y+9{z}^{2}-5x+9=0.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402488 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "e6d1bbdf-cfcb-54f3-b97f-c63787cc6751" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402488 #edb/ref 1074 "First, we complete the square in the $y$ term:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{y}^{2}+8y+9{z}^{2}-5x+9 & =0 \\\\ 4({y}^{2}+2y)+9{z}^{2}-5x+9 & =0 \\\\ 4[(y+1)^{2}-1]+9{z}^{2}-5x+9 & =0 \\\\ 4(y+1)^{2}-4+9{z}^{2}-5x+9 & =0 \\\\ 4(y+1)^{2}+9{z}^{2}-5x+5 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, by rearranging, we get the equation\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4(y+1)^{2}+9{z}^{2}-5x+5 & =0 \\\\ 4(y+1)^{2}+9{z}^{2} & =5(x-1) \\\\ \\frac{4(y+1)^{2}}{5}+\\frac{9{z}^{2}}{5} & =x-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is the equation of an elliptic paraboloid centered at $(1,-1,0).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402489 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402490 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402489 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402491 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402489 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402492 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402489 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402489 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186402494 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402489 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402489 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402489 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186402492 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402489 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "c51d387c-bf0a-5c35-97a8-9dc15337e4ac" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402490 #edb/ref 1080 "A hyperbolic paraboloid centered at $(-1,0,1)$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402490 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186402490 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "adf28e93-9856-5b88-a118-c7fdc1ed380b" #edb/ref 1759218604